("dragoncheer", "Dragon Cheer", "Dragon", "Status", 0, "1", 15, 0, "adjacentAlly", "Raises the target\'s chance for a critical hit by 1 stage, or by 2 stages if the target is Dragon type. Fails if there is no ally adjacent to the user, or if the target already has this effect or the Focus Energy effect. Baton Pass can be used to transfer this effect to an ally.", "Ally: Crit ratio +1, or +2 if ally is Dragon type.", "{\'bypasssub\':1,\'allyanim\':1,\'metronome\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "[]", "dragoncheer", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':913,\'accuracy\':true,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Status\',\'name\':\'Dragon Cheer\',\'pp\':15,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'bypasssub\':1,\'allyanim\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'volatileStatus\':\'dragoncheer\',\'condition\':[],\'target\':\'adjacentAlly\',\'type\':\'Dragon\',\'desc\':\'Raises the target\'s chance for a critical hit by 1 stage, or by 2 stages if the target is Dragon type. Fails if there is no ally adjacent to the user, or if the target already has this effect or the Focus Energy effect. Baton Pass can be used to transfer this effect to an ally.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Ally: Crit ratio +1, or +2 if ally is Dragon type.\'}"),
