("earthpower", "Earth Power", "Ground", "Special", 90, "100", 10, 0, "normal", "Has a 10% chance to lower the target\'s Special Defense by 1 stage.", "10% chance to lower the target\'s Sp. Def by 1.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'nonsky\':1,\'metronome\':1}", "{\'chance\':10,\'boosts\':{\'spd\':-1}}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':414,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':90,\'category\':\'Special\',\'name\':\'Earth Power\',\'pp\':10,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'nonsky\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'secondary\':{\'chance\':10,\'boosts\':{\'spd\':-1}},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Ground\',\'contestType\':\'Beautiful\',\'desc\':\'Has a 10% chance to lower the target\'s Special Defense by 1 stage.\',\'shortDesc\':\'10% chance to lower the target\'s Sp. Def by 1.\'}"),
("earthquake", "Earthquake", "Ground", "Physical", 100, "100", 10, 0, "allAdjacent", "Damage doubles if the target is using Dig.", "Hits adjacent Pokemon. Double damage on Dig.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'nonsky\':1,\'metronome\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':89,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':100,\'category\':\'Physical\',\'name\':\'Earthquake\',\'pp\':10,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'nonsky\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'target\':\'allAdjacent\',\'type\':\'Ground\',\'contestType\':\'Tough\',\'desc\':\'Damage doubles if the target is using Dig.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Hits adjacent Pokemon. Double damage on Dig.\'}"),
("echoedvoice", "Echoed Voice", "Normal", "Special", 40, "100", 15, 0, "normal", "For every consecutive turn that this move is used by at least one Pokemon, this move\'s power is multiplied by the number of turns to pass, but not more than 5.", "Power increases when used on consecutive turns.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'sound\':1,\'bypasssub\':1,\'metronome\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'duration\':2}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':497,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':40,\'basePowerCallback\':true,\'category\':\'Special\',\'name\':\'Echoed Voice\',\'pp\':15,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'sound\':1,\'bypasssub\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'condition\':{\'duration\':2},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Normal\',\'contestType\':\'Beautiful\',\'desc\':\'For every consecutive turn that this move is used by at least one Pokemon, this move\'s power is multiplied by the number of turns to pass, but not more than 5.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Power increases when used on consecutive turns.\'}"),
("eerieimpulse", "Eerie Impulse", "Electric", "Status", 0, "100", 15, 0, "normal", "Lowers the target\'s Special Attack by 2 stages.", "Lowers the target\'s Sp. Atk by 2.", "{\'protect\':1,\'reflectable\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'spa\':-2}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':598,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Status\',\'name\':\'Eerie Impulse\',\'pp\':15,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'reflectable\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'boosts\':{\'spa\':-2},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Electric\',\'zMove\':{\'boost\':{\'spd\':1}},\'contestType\':\'Clever\',\'desc\':\'Lowers the target\'s Special Attack by 2 stages.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Lowers the target\'s Sp. Atk by 2.\'}"),
("eeriespell", "Eerie Spell", "Psychic", "Special", 80, "100", 5, 0, "normal", "If this move is successful and the user has not fainted, the target loses 3 PP from its last move.", "Removes 3 PP from the target\'s last move.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'sound\':1,\'bypasssub\':1,\'metronome\':1}", "{\'chance\':100}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':826,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':80,\'category\':\'Special\',\'name\':\'Eerie Spell\',\'pp\':5,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'sound\':1,\'bypasssub\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'secondary\':{\'chance\':100},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Psychic\',\'desc\':\'If this move is successful and the user has not fainted, the target loses 3 PP from its last move.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Removes 3 PP from the target\'s last move.\'}"),
("eggbomb", "Egg Bomb", "Normal", "Physical", 100, "75", 10, 0, "normal", "No additional effect.", "No additional effect.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'bullet\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':121,\'accuracy\':75,\'basePower\':100,\'category\':\'Physical\',\'isNonstandard\':\'Past\',\'name\':\'Egg Bomb\',\'pp\':10,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'bullet\':1},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Normal\',\'contestType\':\'Cute\',\'desc\':\'No additional effect.\',\'shortDesc\':\'No additional effect.\'}"),
("electricterrain", "Electric Terrain", "Electric", "Status", 0, "1", 10, 0, "all", "For 5 turns, the terrain becomes Electric Terrain. During the effect, the power of Electric-type attacks made by grounded Pokemon is multiplied by 1.3 and grounded Pokemon cannot fall asleep; Pokemon already asleep do not wake up. Grounded Pokemon cannot become affected by Yawn or fall asleep from its effect. Camouflage transforms the user into an Electric type, Nature Power becomes Thunderbolt, and Secret Power has a 30% chance to cause paralysis. Fails if the current terrain is Electric Terrain.", "5 turns. Grounded: +Electric power, can\'t sleep.", "{\'nonsky\':1,\'metronome\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'effectType\':\'Terrain\',\'duration\':5,\'onBasePowerPriority\':6,\'onFieldResidualOrder\':27,\'onFieldResidualSubOrder\':7}", NULL, NULL, NULL, "electricterrain", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':604,\'accuracy\':true,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Status\',\'name\':\'Electric Terrain\',\'pp\':10,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'nonsky\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'terrain\':\'electricterrain\',\'condition\':{\'effectType\':\'Terrain\',\'duration\':5,\'onBasePowerPriority\':6,\'onFieldResidualOrder\':27,\'onFieldResidualSubOrder\':7},\'target\':\'all\',\'type\':\'Electric\',\'zMove\':{\'boost\':{\'spe\':1}},\'contestType\':\'Clever\',\'desc\':\'For 5 turns, the terrain becomes Electric Terrain. During the effect, the power of Electric-type attacks made by grounded Pokemon is multiplied by 1.3 and grounded Pokemon cannot fall asleep; Pokemon already asleep do not wake up. Grounded Pokemon cannot become affected by Yawn or fall asleep from its effect. Camouflage transforms the user into an Electric type, Nature Power becomes Thunderbolt, and Secret Power has a 30% chance to cause paralysis. Fails if the current terrain is Electric Terrain.\',\'shortDesc\':\'5 turns. Grounded: +Electric power, can\'t sleep.\'}"),
("electrify", "Electrify", "Electric", "Status", 0, "1", 20, 0, "normal", "Causes the target\'s move to become Electric type this turn. Among effects that can change a move\'s type, this effect happens last. Fails if the target already moved this turn.", "Changes the target\'s move to Electric this turn.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'allyanim\':1,\'metronome\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'duration\':1,\'onModifyTypePriority\':-2}", "electrify", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':582,\'accuracy\':true,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Status\',\'isNonstandard\':\'Past\',\'name\':\'Electrify\',\'pp\':20,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'allyanim\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'volatileStatus\':\'electrify\',\'condition\':{\'duration\':1,\'onModifyTypePriority\':-2},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Electric\',\'zMove\':{\'boost\':{\'spa\':1}},\'contestType\':\'Clever\',\'desc\':\'Causes the target\'s move to become Electric type this turn. Among effects that can change a move\'s type, this effect happens last. Fails if the target already moved this turn.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Changes the target\'s move to Electric this turn.\'}"),
("electroball", "Electro Ball", "Electric", "Special", 0, "100", 10, 0, "normal", "The power of this move depends on (user\'s current Speed / target\'s current Speed), rounded down. Power is equal to 150 if the result is 4 or more, 120 if 3, 80 if 2, 60 if 1, 40 if less than 1. If the target\'s current Speed is 0, this move\'s power is 40.", "More power the faster the user is than the target.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'bullet\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':486,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':0,\'basePowerCallback\':true,\'category\':\'Special\',\'name\':\'Electro Ball\',\'pp\':10,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'bullet\':1},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Electric\',\'zMove\':{\'basePower\':160},\'maxMove\':{\'basePower\':130},\'contestType\':\'Cool\',\'desc\':\'The power of this move depends on (user\'s current Speed \\/ target\'s current Speed), rounded down. Power is equal to 150 if the result is 4 or more, 120 if 3, 80 if 2, 60 if 1, 40 if less than 1. If the target\'s current Speed is 0, this move\'s power is 40.\',\'shortDesc\':\'More power the faster the user is than the target.\'}"),
("electrodrift", "Electro Drift", "Electric", "Special", 100, "100", 5, 0, "normal", "Damage is multiplied by 1.3333 if this move is super effective against the target.", "Deals 1.3333x damage with supereffective hits.", "{\'contact\':1,\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':879,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':100,\'category\':\'Special\',\'name\':\'Electro Drift\',\'pp\':5,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'contact\':1,\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Electric\',\'contestType\':\'Cool\',\'desc\':\'Damage is multiplied by 1.3333 if this move is super effective against the target.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Deals 1.3333x damage with supereffective hits.\'}"),
("electroshot", "Electro Shot", "Electric", "Special", 130, "100", 10, 0, "normal", "This attack charges on the first turn and executes on the second. Raises the user\'s Special Attack by 1 stage on the first turn. If the user is holding a Power Herb or the weather is Primordial Sea or Rain Dance, the move completes in one turn. If the user is holding Utility Umbrella and the weather is Primordial Sea or Rain Dance, the move still requires a turn to charge.", "Raises Sp. Atk by 1, hits turn 2. Rain: no charge.", "{\'charge\':1,\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':905,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':130,\'category\':\'Special\',\'name\':\'Electro Shot\',\'pp\':10,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'charge\':1,\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'hasSheerForceBoost\':true,\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Electric\',\'desc\':\'This attack charges on the first turn and executes on the second. Raises the user\'s Special Attack by 1 stage on the first turn. If the user is holding a Power Herb or the weather is Primordial Sea or Rain Dance, the move completes in one turn. If the user is holding Utility Umbrella and the weather is Primordial Sea or Rain Dance, the move still requires a turn to charge.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Raises Sp. Atk by 1, hits turn 2. Rain: no charge.\'}"),
("electroweb", "Electroweb", "Electric", "Special", 55, "95", 15, 0, "allAdjacentFoes", "Has a 100% chance to lower the target\'s Speed by 1 stage.", "100% chance to lower the foe(s) Speed by 1.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1}", "{\'chance\':100,\'boosts\':{\'spe\':-1}}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':527,\'accuracy\':95,\'basePower\':55,\'category\':\'Special\',\'name\':\'Electroweb\',\'pp\':15,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'secondary\':{\'chance\':100,\'boosts\':{\'spe\':-1}},\'target\':\'allAdjacentFoes\',\'type\':\'Electric\',\'contestType\':\'Beautiful\',\'desc\':\'Has a 100% chance to lower the target\'s Speed by 1 stage.\',\'shortDesc\':\'100% chance to lower the foe(s) Speed by 1.\'}"),
("embargo", "Embargo", "Dark", "Status", 0, "100", 15, 0, "normal", "For 5 turns, the target\'s held item has no effect. An item\'s effect of causing forme changes is unaffected, but any other effects from such items are negated. During the effect, Fling and Natural Gift are prevented from being used by the target. Items thrown at the target with Fling will still activate for it. If the target uses Baton Pass, the replacement will remain unable to use items.", "For 5 turns, the target\'s item has no effect.", "{\'protect\':1,\'reflectable\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'duration\':5,\'onResidualOrder\':21}", "embargo", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':373,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Status\',\'isNonstandard\':\'Past\',\'name\':\'Embargo\',\'pp\':15,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'reflectable\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'volatileStatus\':\'embargo\',\'condition\':{\'duration\':5,\'onResidualOrder\':21},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Dark\',\'zMove\':{\'boost\':{\'spa\':1}},\'contestType\':\'Clever\',\'desc\':\'For 5 turns, the target\'s held item has no effect. An item\'s effect of causing forme changes is unaffected, but any other effects from such items are negated. During the effect, Fling and Natural Gift are prevented from being used by the target. Items thrown at the target with Fling will still activate for it. If the target uses Baton Pass, the replacement will remain unable to use items.\',\'shortDesc\':\'For 5 turns, the target\'s item has no effect.\'}"),
("ember", "Ember", "Fire", "Special", 40, "100", 25, 0, "normal", "Has a 10% chance to burn the target.", "10% chance to burn the target.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1}", "{\'chance\':10,\'status\':\'brn\'}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':52,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':40,\'category\':\'Special\',\'name\':\'Ember\',\'pp\':25,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'secondary\':{\'chance\':10,\'status\':\'brn\'},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Fire\',\'contestType\':\'Cute\',\'desc\':\'Has a 10% chance to burn the target.\',\'shortDesc\':\'10% chance to burn the target.\'}"),
("encore", "Encore", "Normal", "Status", 0, "100", 5, 0, "normal", "For its next 3 turns, the target is forced to repeat its last move used. If the affected move runs out of PP, the effect ends. Fails if the target is already under this effect, if it has not made a move, if the move has 0 PP, or if the move is Assist, Blazing Torque, Combat Torque, Copycat, Dynamax Cannon, Encore, Magical Torque, Me First, Metronome, Mimic, Mirror Move, Nature Power, Noxious Torque, Sketch, Sleep Talk, Struggle, Transform, or Wicked Torque.", "Target repeats its last move for its next 3 turns.", "{\'protect\':1,\'reflectable\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'bypasssub\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'failencore\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'duration\':3,\'noCopy\':true,\'onResidualOrder\':16}", "encore", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':227,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Status\',\'name\':\'Encore\',\'pp\':5,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'reflectable\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'bypasssub\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'failencore\':1},\'volatileStatus\':\'encore\',\'condition\':{\'duration\':3,\'noCopy\':true,\'onResidualOrder\':16},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Normal\',\'zMove\':{\'boost\':{\'spe\':1}},\'contestType\':\'Cute\',\'desc\':\'For its next 3 turns, the target is forced to repeat its last move used. If the affected move runs out of PP, the effect ends. Fails if the target is already under this effect, if it has not made a move, if the move has 0 PP, or if the move is Assist, Blazing Torque, Combat Torque, Copycat, Dynamax Cannon, Encore, Magical Torque, Me First, Metronome, Mimic, Mirror Move, Nature Power, Noxious Torque, Sketch, Sleep Talk, Struggle, Transform, or Wicked Torque.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Target repeats its last move for its next 3 turns.\'}"),
("endeavor", "Endeavor", "Normal", "Physical", 0, "100", 5, 0, "normal", "Deals damage to the target equal to (target\'s current HP - user\'s current HP). The target is unaffected if its current HP is less than or equal to the user\'s current HP.", "Lowers the target\'s HP to the user\'s HP.", "{\'contact\':1,\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'noparentalbond\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':283,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Physical\',\'name\':\'Endeavor\',\'pp\':5,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'contact\':1,\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'noparentalbond\':1},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Normal\',\'zMove\':{\'basePower\':160},\'maxMove\':{\'basePower\':130},\'contestType\':\'Tough\',\'desc\':\'Deals damage to the target equal to (target\'s current HP - user\'s current HP). The target is unaffected if its current HP is less than or equal to the user\'s current HP.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Lowers the target\'s HP to the user\'s HP.\'}"),
("endure", "Endure", "Normal", "Status", 0, "1", 10, 4, "self", "The user will survive attacks made by other Pokemon during this turn with at least 1 HP. This move has a 1/X chance of being successful, where X starts at 1 and triples each time this move is successfully used. X resets to 1 if this move fails, if the user\'s last move used is not Baneful Bunker, Burning Bulwark, Detect, Endure, King\'s Shield, Max Guard, Obstruct, Protect, Quick Guard, Silk Trap, Spiky Shield, or Wide Guard, or if it was one of those moves and the user\'s protection was broken. Fails if the user moves last this turn.", "User survives attacks this turn with at least 1 HP.", "{\'noassist\':1,\'failcopycat\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'duration\':1,\'onDamagePriority\':-10}", "endure", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':203,\'accuracy\':true,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Status\',\'name\':\'Endure\',\'pp\':10,\'priority\':4,\'flags\':{\'noassist\':1,\'failcopycat\':1},\'stallingMove\':true,\'volatileStatus\':\'endure\',\'condition\':{\'duration\':1,\'onDamagePriority\':-10},\'target\':\'self\',\'type\':\'Normal\',\'zMove\':{\'effect\':\'clearnegativeboost\'},\'contestType\':\'Tough\',\'desc\':\'The user will survive attacks made by other Pokemon during this turn with at least 1 HP. This move has a 1\\/X chance of being successful, where X starts at 1 and triples each time this move is successfully used. X resets to 1 if this move fails, if the user\'s last move used is not Baneful Bunker, Burning Bulwark, Detect, Endure, King\'s Shield, Max Guard, Obstruct, Protect, Quick Guard, Silk Trap, Spiky Shield, or Wide Guard, or if it was one of those moves and the user\'s protection was broken. Fails if the user moves last this turn.\',\'shortDesc\':\'User survives attacks this turn with at least 1 HP.\'}"),
("energyball", "Energy Ball", "Grass", "Special", 90, "100", 10, 0, "normal", "Has a 10% chance to lower the target\'s Special Defense by 1 stage.", "10% chance to lower the target\'s Sp. Def by 1.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'bullet\':1}", "{\'chance\':10,\'boosts\':{\'spd\':-1}}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':412,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':90,\'category\':\'Special\',\'name\':\'Energy Ball\',\'pp\':10,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'bullet\':1},\'secondary\':{\'chance\':10,\'boosts\':{\'spd\':-1}},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Grass\',\'contestType\':\'Beautiful\',\'desc\':\'Has a 10% chance to lower the target\'s Special Defense by 1 stage.\',\'shortDesc\':\'10% chance to lower the target\'s Sp. Def by 1.\'}"),
("entrainment", "Entrainment", "Normal", "Status", 0, "100", 15, 0, "normal", "Causes the target\'s Ability to become the same as the user\'s. Fails if the target\'s Ability is As One, Battle Bond, Comatose, Disguise, Gulp Missile, Ice Face, Multitype, Power Construct, RKS System, Schooling, Shields Down, Stance Change, Tera Shift, Truant, Zen Mode, or Zero to Hero, or the same Ability as the user, or if the user\'s Ability is As One, Battle Bond, Comatose, Commander, Disguise, Embody Aspect, Flower Gift, Forecast, Hunger Switch, Ice Face, Illusion, Imposter, Multitype, Neutralizing Gas, Poison Puppeteer, Power Construct, Power of Alchemy, Protosynthesis, Quark Drive, Receiver, RKS System, Schooling, Shields Down, Stance Change, Tera Shell, Tera Shift, Teraform Zero, Trace, Wonder Guard, Zen Mode, or Zero to Hero.", "The target\'s Ability changes to match the user\'s.", "{\'protect\':1,\'reflectable\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'allyanim\':1,\'metronome\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':494,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Status\',\'name\':\'Entrainment\',\'pp\':15,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'reflectable\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'allyanim\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Normal\',\'zMove\':{\'boost\':{\'spd\':1}},\'contestType\':\'Cute\',\'desc\':\'Causes the target\'s Ability to become the same as the user\'s. Fails if the target\'s Ability is As One, Battle Bond, Comatose, Disguise, Gulp Missile, Ice Face, Multitype, Power Construct, RKS System, Schooling, Shields Down, Stance Change, Tera Shift, Truant, Zen Mode, or Zero to Hero, or the same Ability as the user, or if the user\'s Ability is As One, Battle Bond, Comatose, Commander, Disguise, Embody Aspect, Flower Gift, Forecast, Hunger Switch, Ice Face, Illusion, Imposter, Multitype, Neutralizing Gas, Poison Puppeteer, Power Construct, Power of Alchemy, Protosynthesis, Quark Drive, Receiver, RKS System, Schooling, Shields Down, Stance Change, Tera Shell, Tera Shift, Teraform Zero, Trace, Wonder Guard, Zen Mode, or Zero to Hero.\',\'shortDesc\':\'The target\'s Ability changes to match the user\'s.\'}"),
