("explosion", "Explosion", "Normal", "Physical", 250, "100", 5, 0, "allAdjacent", "The user faints after using this move, even if this move fails for having no target. This move is prevented from executing if any active Pokemon has the Damp Ability.", "Hits adjacent Pokemon. The user faints.", "{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'noparentalbond\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':153,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':250,\'category\':\'Physical\',\'name\':\'Explosion\',\'pp\':5,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'noparentalbond\':1},\'selfdestruct\':\'always\',\'target\':\'allAdjacent\',\'type\':\'Normal\',\'contestType\':\'Beautiful\',\'desc\':\'The user faints after using this move, even if this move fails for having no target. This move is prevented from executing if any active Pokemon has the Damp Ability.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Hits adjacent Pokemon. The user faints.\'}"),
