("flareblitz", "Flare Blitz", "Fire", "Physical", 120, "100", 15, 0, "normal", "Has a 10% chance to burn the target. If the target lost HP, the user takes recoil damage equal to 33% the HP lost by the target, rounded half up, but not less than 1 HP.", "Has 33% recoil. 10% chance to burn. Thaws user.", "{\'contact\':1,\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'defrost\':1,\'metronome\':1}", "{\'chance\':10,\'status\':\'brn\'}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "[33,100]", NULL, "{\'num\':394,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':120,\'category\':\'Physical\',\'name\':\'Flare Blitz\',\'pp\':15,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'contact\':1,\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'defrost\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'recoil\':[33,100],\'secondary\':{\'chance\':10,\'status\':\'brn\'},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Fire\',\'contestType\':\'Cool\',\'desc\':\'Has a 10% chance to burn the target. If the target lost HP, the user takes recoil damage equal to 33% the HP lost by the target, rounded half up, but not less than 1 HP.\',\'shortDesc\':\'Has 33% recoil. 10% chance to burn. Thaws user.\'}"),
