("horndrill", "Horn Drill", "Normal", "Physical", 0, "30", 5, 0, "normal", "Deals damage to the target equal to the target\'s maximum HP. Ignores accuracy and evasiveness modifiers. This attack\'s accuracy is equal to (user\'s level - target\'s level + 30)%, and fails if the target is at a higher level. Pokemon with the Sturdy Ability are immune.", "OHKOs the target. Fails if user is a lower level.", "{\'contact\':1,\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':32,\'accuracy\':30,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Physical\',\'name\':\'Horn Drill\',\'pp\':5,\'priority\':0,\'flags\':{\'contact\':1,\'protect\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'metronome\':1},\'ohko\':true,\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Normal\',\'zMove\':{\'basePower\':180},\'maxMove\':{\'basePower\':130},\'contestType\':\'Cool\',\'desc\':\'Deals damage to the target equal to the target\'s maximum HP. Ignores accuracy and evasiveness modifiers. This attack\'s accuracy is equal to (user\'s level - target\'s level + 30)%, and fails if the target is at a higher level. Pokemon with the Sturdy Ability are immune.\',\'shortDesc\':\'OHKOs the target. Fails if user is a lower level.\'}"),
