("powder", "Powder", "Bug", "Status", 0, "100", 20, 1, "normal", "If the target uses a Fire-type move this turn, it is prevented from executing and the target loses 1/4 of its maximum HP, rounded half up. This effect does not happen if the Fire-type move is prevented by Primordial Sea.", "If using a Fire move, target loses 1/4 max HP.", "{\'protect\':1,\'reflectable\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'bypasssub\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'powder\':1}", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'duration\':1,\'onTryMovePriority\':-1}", "powder", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, "{\'num\':600,\'accuracy\':100,\'basePower\':0,\'category\':\'Status\',\'isNonstandard\':\'Past\',\'name\':\'Powder\',\'pp\':20,\'priority\':1,\'flags\':{\'protect\':1,\'reflectable\':1,\'mirror\':1,\'bypasssub\':1,\'metronome\':1,\'powder\':1},\'volatileStatus\':\'powder\',\'condition\':{\'duration\':1,\'onTryMovePriority\':-1},\'target\':\'normal\',\'type\':\'Bug\',\'zMove\':{\'boost\':{\'spd\':2}},\'contestType\':\'Clever\',\'desc\':\'If the target uses a Fire-type move this turn, it is prevented from executing and the target loses 1\\/4 of its maximum HP, rounded half up. This effect does not happen if the Fire-type move is prevented by Primordial Sea.\',\'shortDesc\':\'If using a Fire move, target loses 1\\/4 max HP.\'}"),
